{
  "_readme": "The scroll score: where every section of the tour sits on the scroll, and the animation timelines inside it. Majors are the sections (ids match manifest.json, in order); minors are an exhibit's timelines and story beats. One press of Down plays one major from the station you are on to the end of its body; `body.ms` and `body.play` set how long that takes and where nothing happens, `dwell` how a minor's beats are eased, `in.hold` how long a part statement stands, `out.ms` how long the camera travel takes. Read by score.js; every field is documented at the top of that file. Positions and paces are design, not content: edit here, refresh, no build. ?pace=0.25 on the page plays everything four times faster.",
